(
 '# The "n" namespace'
 ''
 'The `n` contains all the usual stuff as →[*.N_Namespace|documented here].'
 ''
 'Since `StdForm` is used by almost all other `APLGUI` main classes the `n` namespace of, say, a'
 '`SelectionTool` instance is originally the `n` namespace created when `StdForm` is instantiated'
 'but then other stuff is added to it.'
 ''
